```ejs
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
    <title>Load Shedding Schedule Notification</title>
  </head>

  <body
    style="
      margin: 0;
      padding: 0;
      background-color: #f4f6f8;
      font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;
      color: #1f2937;
    "
  >
    <div style="max-width: 600px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 24px 16px">
      <div
        style="
          background-color: #ffffff;
          border-radius: 12px;
          overflow: hidden;
          border: 1px solid #e5e7eb;
        "
      >
        <!-- Header -->
        <div
          style="
            background-color: #1d4ed8;
            padding: 28px 24px;
            text-align: center;
            color: #ffffff;
          "
        >
          <h1 style="margin: 0; font-size: 24px">Load Shedding Notification</h1>

          <p style="margin: 10px 0 0; font-size: 14px; color: #dbeafe">
            Load Shedding &amp; Power Management System
          </p>
        </div>

        <!-- Email Content -->
        <div style="padding: 28px 24px">
          <p style="margin: 0 0 16px; font-size: 16px">Dear Customer,</p>

          <p
            style="
              margin: 0 0 24px;
              font-size: 15px;
              line-height: 1.7;
              color: #4b5563;
            "
          >
            A load-shedding schedule has been published by the Power Operator.
            Please check the details below and plan your activities accordingly.
          </p>

          <!-- Schedule Details -->
          <div
            style="
              background-color: #eff6ff;
              border: 1px solid #bfdbfe;
              border-radius: 8px;
              padding: 20px;
            "
          >
            <h2 style="margin: 0 0 20px; font-size: 18px; color: #1d4ed8">
              Scheduled Outage Details
            </h2>

            <p style="margin: 0 0 16px; font-size: 14px; color: #6b7280">
              Scheduled Date
              <br />
              <strong
                style="
                  display: inline-block;
                  margin-top: 6px;
                  font-size: 17px;
                  color: #111827;
                "
              >
                <%= date %>
              </strong>
            </p>

            <div style="border-top: 1px solid #dbeafe; margin: 16px 0"></div>

            <p style="margin: 0 0 16px; font-size: 14px; color: #6b7280">
              Power Outage Starts At
              <br />
              <strong
                style="
                  display: inline-block;
                  margin-top: 6px;
                  font-size: 17px;
                  color: #b91c1c;
                "
              >
                <%= start_time %>
              </strong>
            </p>

            <div style="border-top: 1px solid #dbeafe; margin: 16px 0"></div>

            <p style="margin: 0; font-size: 14px; color: #6b7280">
              Expected Power Restoration
              <br />
              <strong
                style="
                  display: inline-block;
                  margin-top: 6px;
                  font-size: 17px;
                  color: #15803d;
                "
              >
                <%= end_time %>
              </strong>
            </p>
          </div>

          <p
            style="
              margin: 24px 0 0;
              font-size: 14px;
              line-height: 1.7;
              color: #4b5563;
            "
          >
            We apologize for the inconvenience and appreciate your patience.
            Please note that the schedule may change due to operational
            requirements.
          </p>

          <p style="margin: 24px 0 0; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.6">
            Best regards,<br />
            <strong>Power Management Team</strong><br />
            <span style="color: #6b7280">
              Load Shedding &amp; Power Management System
            </span>
          </p>
        </div>

        <!-- Footer -->
        <div
          style="
            background-color: #f9fafb;
            border-top: 1px solid #e5e7eb;
            padding: 16px 24px;
            text-align: center;
            font-size: 12px;
            line-height: 1.6;
            color: #6b7280;
          "
        >
          This is an automated notification. Please do not reply to this email.
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </body>
</html>
```
